abstract: |
  An agentic Python CLI application that leverages Grok (via the xAI API) 
  together with Wikipedia and web search tools to deliver tailored, 
  up-to-date information about Linux distributions for different expertise 
  levels and architectures. Features rich terminal output, query history, 
  and optional random-distro exploration mode.
